  "title": "TMP36 thermometer on a Nano",
  "summary": "Move the temperature slider. A TMP36 analog temperature sensor drives A0 with 750 mV at 25 °C and 10 mV/°C; the Nano converts it to voltage and °C and prints both over Serial.",
